{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/Steam_discord_banner.png?t=1748814466\" /><strong>Play the free demo of this turn-based pirate strategy game!</strong> Command your ship in intense naval battles, make bold decisions, and outsmart rival captains. This is just a glimpse\u2014<strong>the full game offers even more challenges, depth, customization, and chaos on the high seas!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/Header_1.png?t=1748814466\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/1.gif?t=1748814466\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Execute moves simultaneously for strategic prediction and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate obstacles and leverage the environment to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize the wind to reduce movement costs when sailing with it, avoid the storm or use it to escape chasing players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fear the ever-growing curse of the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/Header_2.png?t=1748814466\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/2.gif?t=1748814466\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick between various upgrades to increase your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash environmental chaos causing misfortune throughout the seven seas, giving you both advantages and disadvantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steer the course of battle by picking between special mythic perks with even greater powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MORE TO COME IN THE FULL RELEASE..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/Header_3.png?t=1748814466\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/3.gif?t=1748814466\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your crew, giving them tasks like fishing, treasure hunting, and resource gathering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your ship and customize components for increased sail speed, greater defenses, better vision, and faster repairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick and play a role in your fleet and contribute to a strongly drafted crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/Header_4.png?t=1748814466\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/extras/4.gif?t=1748814466\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge epic bosses, wield their powers, and unlock abilities to cause havoc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight sea monsters for valuable upgrades and significant buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat AI fleets and mighty pirate ships, or invite them to battle on your side for a good deal.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256770?t=1748814466","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256770?t=1748814466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256770/d46fbabaf6b58772b131f9357b71fdceb7f9e384/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748814466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset